window.EN={"1":"Taking August's counsel, Leif and his army circle around the south side of the highway.","2":"But to reach Leonster by this route,","3":"it was necessary to cross the forest region of Melfiye, called the \"Forest of the Lost.\"","4":"Why it is called the \"Forest of the Lost,\" why people try to avoid it,","5":"Leif and his army would come to learn firsthand.","6":"This forest is the great forest of Melfiye, commonly known as the \"Forest of the Lost.\"","7":"The Forest of the Lost... So, which way should we go?","8":"If we can get out to the northeast of the forest, Leonster Castle is right before us.","9":"However, so that no one falls behind, it would be best for us to go last.","10":"Understood. Tell everyone, too, not to relax their attention.","11":"Now, let's set out!","12":"Lord Reincock, is something the matter?","13":"Heh heh heh... Look into this orb. Prey has wandered in.","14":"An army... it is... Then, Count Conomor of Ulster, to take back Princess Miranda...","15":"No, he is not that much of a fool.","16":"Most likely the survivors of Leonster. Do they not mean to retake the castle?","17":"So they avoided the well-defended western front and chose this forest. How foolish...","18":"For us, it means a nice way to kill time has come along.","19":"Well, only those with their hands free will do. Have them take their positions.","20":"Sir. And what will you do, Father?","21":"Heh, me... I'll try this out.","22":"Oh, that is a Berserk staff... That does indeed sound amusing.","23":"Heh heh heh...","24":"You look like you're having fun, Reincock.","25":"Lady Sara!?...","26":"You must not come to a place like this. Please return to your room.","27":"But I'm bored. Where's Grandfather...?","28":"Archbishop Manfroy is in Connacht with His Highness Julius.","29":"I expect he will return before long...","30":"If it was going to be like this, I shouldn't have come along. Ahh, so boring...","31":"Huh...? Who, who is it...","32":"Lady Sara? Is something wrong?","33":"No... it's nothing. Hey, Reincock, can I go for a little walk?","34":"Th-that would be a problem. Please, Lady Sara, stay put.","35":"Lady Sara!? Why are you in a place like this?","36":"Who are you? I don't know you.","37":"Yes...","38":"I was once a priest of Loptr, but it is only natural that you, Lady Sara, the Archbishop's granddaughter, would not know me.","39":"Hmm... is that so... But I've no business with you. I'm looking for the owner of the voice.","40":"The owner of the voice...?","41":"A very beautiful voice... It's calling me. It wants me to help...","42":"...I see...","43":"Lady Sara, being Archbishop Manfroy's granddaughter, can use the Kia Staff... So that's what it means...","44":"Hmm... Bye then, Salem...","45":"Huh? A girl in a forest like this...?","46":"......","47":"Who are you? Are you alone...?","48":"Hmm... So it's you...","49":"Huh? What do you mean?","50":"Heehee... I knew it. All right, I'll help you.","51":"This is a problem... August and Dorias aren't here right now. What should I do...","52":"My name is Sara. I know everything about you.","53":"Your name is Leif. You're the prince of Leonster, right? And your father is called Quan.","54":"Your mother was a lovely person called Ethlyn, but she died, didn't she?","55":"!....","56":"You don't have to make such a scary face.","57":"My papa and mama died too. Mama when I was little.","58":"Papa... they say that loving Mama brought down Grandfather's anger, and he was killed.","59":"It's a story from before I was born.","60":".......","61":"You're the one who was calling me. So I thought I'd help you, but... if you're going to treat me like a nuisance, forget it!","62":"Wait! I don't really understand, but I feel like this is something very important.","63":"I want to know more about you. Will you come with me?","64":"Yes, okay. Because I like your voice.","65":"Thank you... Sara...","66":"Hey, Shannam, long time no see.","67":"Gulp...","68":"So this time you're a pawn of Loptr. You really don't care who you work for.","69":"N-no... It's not as if I'm doing it because I like it... I ran out of money, so I had no choice...","70":"Well, fine, do as you like. It's nothing to do with me.","71":"W-wait! Are you going to leave me all alone in a place like this?","72":"Help me out. We're friends, aren't we?","73":"I told you, do as you like. If you want to tag along, that's fine too.","74":"Mm... I am obliged... You have my thanks.","75":"Doesn't resemble him one bit...","76":"This is a monastery of the Loptr Church. It seems the priests have all fled...","77":"Prince! There was someone held captive inside the monastery. She says she wishes to see you...","78":"I'll see her. Bring her here.","79":"Prince Leif... it has been a long time...","80":"Who are you?","81":"\"Who are you?\"... you say...?","82":"Have you forgotten!? I am Miranda of Ulster!!","83":"Princess Miranda? The princess of Ulster? It can't be... Why are you here...","84":"You didn't recognize me? I suppose not. I look so wretched and fallen.","85":"But all of this, Prince, all of it is your fault!","86":"Mine? Why?","87":"It all began when you people came fleeing from Leonster.","88":"My father was a gentle man who did not like fighting. He had no reason whatsoever to quarrel with the Empire. And yet... and yet...","89":"Just because he sheltered you, he earned the Empire's resentment and invited its interference!","90":"My father handed me over as a hostage, was stripped of his authority as king, and departed this world in despair...","91":"Prince, I resent you!","92":"If only you... if only you had not come to Ulster, this would never have...","93":"......","94":"...Princess Miranda, is that not mistaken?","95":"The Empire meant to seize Ulster from the start, and the prince was nothing but a pretext.","96":"Forgive me for saying so, but your father, Princess, was far too faint-hearted.","97":"Though he had a valiant order of knights, when Thracia invaded he alone chose to sit on the fence,","98":"and even in the crisis of Leonster, his ally, he would not move his soldiers. This is the result.","99":"That the country fell is the king's own responsibility!","100":"Is it not misplaced to resent the prince!","101":"Stop, Dorias! What good does it do to speak of that now!","102":"Sir... I did indeed say too much... Forgive me.","103":"Princess Miranda, I'm sorry... I want you to forgive me...","104":"But to think you were shut up in a place like this...","105":"It must have been very hard. I should have come to save you much sooner.","106":"...Until last year I was in Ulster.","107":"I was watched, but Count Conomor was there for me, so I was not so badly off.","108":"But revolts broke out in Tahra and Leonster, and in Ulster too some people plotted a revolt,","109":"and the Empire must have grown uneasy. They moved me to this monastery.","110":"So that's how it was...","111":"Prince Leif, if there was no falsehood in what you said just now, lend me your strength!","112":"I want to take back Ulster... I want to avenge my father's bitterness. Please!","113":"We managed to get through somehow.","114":"Even so, that there should be a Loptr monastery in a place like this...","115":"It was a failing on my part, August's...","116":"No, don't let it trouble you. Even you are not a god.","117":"But this certainly is the Forest of the Lost. It's a wonder we got through.","118":"What, are you folks lost? Huh, you're not? You chose to come here on purpose?","119":"...But you folks have faces that say you're amateurs when it comes to this forest, any way I look at it.","120":"All right, I'll tell you one good thing. This forest has secret contrivances set up all over the place.","121":"Whether that's a good thing or a bad thing for you, I couldn't say.","122":"To set foot on Loptr's ground... how foolish...","123":"...O God... save me... gwah!","124":"I have nothing to say...","125":"W-wait a second, let's talk...","126":"Th-that's absurd...","127":"I'll give you my thanks, for now. Heh...","128":"...Do you... hate me?","129":"...Lonely...","130":"...Boring..."};
